*.flac
*.ogg
*.m4a
speakers.db
*.db
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
consent_forms/
skg_store/
# The API's store: voiceprints next to hometowns, schools and family names.
data/
# Returned participant recordings, before ingest pseudonymises them. The audio
# extensions above already cover the files; this covers the *folder names*,
# which arrive as people's first names and are therefore direct identifiers.
recordings/
# Same thing under whatever name the next drop arrives as. A returned batch is
# named by whoever sent it, not by this repo's conventions, so the rule has to
# cover the shape rather than the spelling: any top-level folder of participant
# audio is unpublishable until `kavach.ingest` has replaced the names with
# pseudonyms.
SpeechData/

