# ---- Generated figures ----
# `python -m kavach.experiments` regenerates these from results.json on every
# run, so the binaries are churn. results.json and tables/*.tex are NOT ignored:
# they are the numbers the paper reads, and a reviewer asking "which commit
# produced table 3" is answered by having them in the history.
paper/results/figures/
